{"concept":"bestowing-virtue","groups":[{"id":"source-use","name":{"ru":"Употребления в речи, образе и действии","en":"Uses in speech, image and action"},"count":47}],"occurrences":[{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-86b4f442b37cc5ac7c949915868d53dd","tos.text-unit.sid-86b4f442b37cc5ac7c949915868d53dd"]},"form":"verschenken","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"sun","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["becoming","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Переполненная мудрость хочет стать даром.","en":"Overflowing wisdom wants to become a gift."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-cebae271f3d232a1dc2e1a9564c8b8e0","tos.text-unit.sid-cebae271f3d232a1dc2e1a9564c8b8e0"]},"form":"Geschenk","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"saint","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Заратустра объявляет людям свой дар.","en":"Zarathustra announces his gift to people."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-1af39a4d5256f672c2e64f1b997143f0","tos.text-unit.sid-1af39a4d5256f672c2e64f1b997143f0"]},"form":"schenken","speaker":"saint","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["laughter","saint"],"line":{"ru":"Святой ставит вопрос о способности людей принять сокровища.","en":"The saint raises the question of people accepting treasures."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-422a1876f8e691263180e983a5eb96d4","tos.text-unit.sid-422a1876f8e691263180e983a5eb96d4"]},"form":"Geschenke","speaker":"saint","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"source-use","neighbours":["laughter","saint"],"line":{"ru":"Святой славит Бога пением, плачем и смехом и спрашивает о даре.","en":"The saint praises God through song, tears and laughter and asks about the gift."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-f39eb4bbf397af1da21109d71b97787e","tos.text-unit.sid-f39eb4bbf397af1da21109d71b97787e"]},"form":"schenkt","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"people","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Расточающая душа дарит, выходя за расчёт благодарности.","en":"The lavish soul gives beyond the calculation of gratitude."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-1854da398df3ee2655605c8612f6d608","tos.text-unit.sid-1854da398df3ee2655605c8612f6d608"]},"form":"schenken","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["overman","becoming","last-man","joy-lust","zarathustra","people"],"line":{"ru":"Народ предлагает сверхчеловека в обмен на жизнь последнего человека.","en":"The people offer the overman in exchange for the last man’s life."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.10","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-0e680d02bed23d6daefc00d745d26880","tos.text-unit.sid-0e680d02bed23d6daefc00d745d26880"]},"form":"Geschenken","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Дары способны ещё крепче привязать другого к жизни.","en":"Gifts can bind another more firmly to life."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.17","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-19429019e45aeaf5eae5fefdbb28a229","tos.text-unit.sid-19429019e45aeaf5eae5fefdbb28a229"]},"form":"verschenken","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["creation","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Творческий друг дарит завершённый мир.","en":"The creative friend gives a completed world."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.19","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-9340995fed68797913d14822c1682826","tos.text-unit.sid-9340995fed68797913d14822c1682826"]},"form":"geschenkt","speaker":"unidentified-questioner","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"source-use","neighbours":["child","becoming","identity","unidentified-questioner"],"line":{"ru":"Старушка спрашивает о спрятанном сокровище или ребёнке.","en":"The old woman asks about a hidden treasure or child."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.19","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-c73b65ecfac35c2110a60a8b6fd758c1","tos.text-unit.sid-c73b65ecfac35c2110a60a8b6fd758c1"]},"form":"geschenkt","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"unidentified-questioner","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["becoming","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Заратустра называет несомую истину подаренным сокровищем.","en":"Zarathustra calls the truth he carries a given treasure."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.20","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-7d5819693a40f5731fbc1f75435ce157","tos.text-unit.sid-7d5819693a40f5731fbc1f75435ce157"]},"form":"schenken","speaker":"narrator","addressee":"","mode":"narration","use":"narration","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","bite","zarathustra","adder"],"line":{"ru":"Укус гадюки будит путника; его благодарность превращает встречу.","en":"The adder’s bite wakes the traveller; his gratitude changes the encounter."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.23","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-2a1b29f9c62115040c9a0330cad6d16e","tos.text-unit.sid-2a1b29f9c62115040c9a0330cad6d16e"]},"form":"schenkt","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"disciples","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["tablets-values","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Золото ценится сиянием и непрерывным дарением себя.","en":"Gold is valued for shining and continually giving itself."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.23","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-3d2797d3bc2f76f6de279d6b136a5af5","tos.text-unit.sid-3d2797d3bc2f76f6de279d6b136a5af5"]},"form":"Schenkenden","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"disciples","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["tablets-values","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Золото становится образом высшей добродетели.","en":"Gold becomes the image of the highest virtue."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.23","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-8bfa6cb283fd04386a7c9d6b5e57aab1","tos.text-unit.sid-8bfa6cb283fd04386a7c9d6b5e57aab1"]},"form":"schenkende","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"disciples","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Дарящая добродетель названа высшей.","en":"Bestowing virtue is named the highest."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.23","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-0bf5dc6e46a7e01998dcc4a952efd3c7","tos.text-unit.sid-0bf5dc6e46a7e01998dcc4a952efd3c7"]},"form":"schenkenden","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"disciples","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["identity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Ученики стремятся к дарящей добродетели учителя.","en":"The disciples seek their teacher’s bestowing virtue."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.23","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-251b38ef10445406730ded971288bfb1","tos.text-unit.sid-251b38ef10445406730ded971288bfb1"]},"form":"Geschenken","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"disciples","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["becoming","identity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Жажда стать дарами требует собирать богатства души.","en":"Thirst to become gifts calls for gathering the soul’s riches."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.23","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-d267324bfa69c6374e02e57414e90d49","tos.text-unit.sid-d267324bfa69c6374e02e57414e90d49"]},"form":"Verschenken","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"disciples","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Ненасытность дара определяет накопление сокровищ.","en":"Giving’s insatiability directs the gathering of treasures."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.23","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-7bd27dc521474b57a0c74384f08d80c3","tos.text-unit.sid-7bd27dc521474b57a0c74384f08d80c3"]},"form":"schenkende","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"disciples","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["becoming","tablets-values","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Дарящая любовь присваивает ценности ради их отдачи.","en":"Bestowing love appropriates values to give them away."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.23","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-b9bc818b6283952c1698ce6ec3a2f625","tos.text-unit.sid-b9bc818b6283952c1698ce6ec3a2f625"]},"form":"Schenkenden","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"disciples","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Больная жадность крадётся у стола дарящих.","en":"Sick greed prowls around the givers’ table."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.23","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-dfbf765c1fd6a1db719776653d6b8b90","tos.text-unit.sid-dfbf765c1fd6a1db719776653d6b8b90"]},"form":"schenkende","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"disciples","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Отсутствие дарящей души становится признаком упадка.","en":"The absence of a bestowing soul becomes a sign of decline."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.23","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-6ef116aacecef01c18f461c20ba52cdb","tos.text-unit.sid-6ef116aacecef01c18f461c20ba52cdb"]},"form":"schenkende","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"disciples","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["earth","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Дарящая любовь и познание служат смыслу земли.","en":"Bestowing love and knowledge serve earth’s meaning."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-f916f2a02d92c136ced7ea1aa15a8f83","tos.text-unit.sid-f916f2a02d92c136ced7ea1aa15a8f83"]},"form":"Schenkender","speaker":"narrator","addressee":"","mode":"narration","use":"narration","group":"source-use","neighbours":["becoming","identity","loneliness"],"line":{"ru":"Любовь учит дарящего вовремя закрывать открытую руку.","en":"Love teaches the giver when to close the open hand."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-048901ec9c49143f8e2c18239ac533b5","tos.text-unit.sid-048901ec9c49143f8e2c18239ac533b5"]},"form":"schenken","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"animals","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["agency","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Возвращение к друзьям вновь открывает речь, любовь и дарение.","en":"Returning to friends reopens speech, love and giving."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.03","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-bd9c76e6a1518023e4bacfc1da55cfad","tos.text-unit.sid-bd9c76e6a1518023e4bacfc1da55cfad"]},"form":"verschenken","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Принятие дара предложено как способ оказать честь.","en":"Receiving a gift is offered as a way to confer distinction."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.03","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-09b9bca89edae4834da231d217a4db61","tos.text-unit.sid-09b9bca89edae4834da231d217a4db61"]},"form":"Schenkender","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["identity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Дарящий бережёт принимающего от стыда.","en":"The giver protects the recipient from shame."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.09","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-f94c12888dfe69bf80c5c4baf348c914","tos.text-unit.sid-f94c12888dfe69bf80c5c4baf348c914"]},"form":"Geschenke","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","affirmation","identity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Светящий хочет благословить чужие световые дары.","en":"The shining one wants to bless others’ gifts of light."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.09","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-41eef4679b9a9aacfbb78c5551dd0ded","tos.text-unit.sid-41eef4679b9a9aacfbb78c5551dd0ded"]},"form":"Schenken","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Непрерывное дарение рождает собственную бедность.","en":"Continual giving generates its own poverty."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.09","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-f49bbb4996c1e7aa11c07b808b428b9f","tos.text-unit.sid-2843a99935e60d5c350f2a16c2f89f12"]},"form":"Schenkenden","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Дарящий спрашивает, касается ли ещё души принимающего.","en":"The giver asks whether he still touches the recipient’s soul."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.09","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-c245a4e237adfdd27ef9593ef422ea31","tos.text-unit.sid-c245a4e237adfdd27ef9593ef422ea31"]},"form":"Beschenkten","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Полнота дарящего рождает желание отнять дар.","en":"The giver’s fullness breeds a desire to take the gift away."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.09","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-915d67c26466773986f97d75173e94e4","tos.text-unit.sid-915d67c26466773986f97d75173e94e4"]},"form":"Schenken","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"source-use","neighbours":["becoming","identity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Счастье дарения истощается собственным избытком.","en":"The happiness of giving exhausts itself through excess."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.09","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-2164fb8a5ad05ece977ae7ce37b3badc","tos.text-unit.sid-2164fb8a5ad05ece977ae7ce37b3badc"]},"form":"schenkt","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Непрерывное дарение грозит потерей стыда и огрубением.","en":"Continual giving risks losing shame and becoming callous."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.09","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-600e6ab99f37af138840458f18fb74b8","tos.text-unit.sid-600e6ab99f37af138840458f18fb74b8"]},"form":"Schenkenden","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"source-use","neighbours":["loneliness","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Дарящий поёт одиночество светящих.","en":"The giver sings the shining ones’ solitude."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.10","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-6f8984c5f6461bc117ffce7e071553e9","tos.text-unit.sid-6f8984c5f6461bc117ffce7e071553e9"]},"form":"beschenkt","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"life","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra","life"],"line":{"ru":"Жизнь замечает, что мужчины дарят ей собственные добродетели.","en":"Life observes that men give it their own virtues."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.05","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-c109d41739a0996c3ff2df40bfd28f15","tos.text-unit.sid-c109d41739a0996c3ff2df40bfd28f15"]},"form":"beschenkt","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Похвала раскрывается желанием получить новые дары.","en":"Praise unfolds as a desire to receive new gifts."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.09","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-d8a9c07bd114fa00407eee4645c5ba32","tos.text-unit.sid-d8a9c07bd114fa00407eee4645c5ba32"]},"form":"schenkend","speaker":"loneliness","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"quoted","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["loneliness"],"line":{"ru":"Одиночество вспоминает дарящий источник среди пустых сосудов.","en":"Solitude recalls the bestowing spring among empty vessels."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.10","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-b69d82eaac6c528f99194ce43bae671c","tos.text-unit.sid-b69d82eaac6c528f99194ce43bae671c"]},"form":"Schenkende","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Нисхождение одинокой высоты получает имя дарящей добродетели.","en":"The descent of the solitary height receives the name bestowing virtue."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-c8e9e850b816f1db51f391e81ec26f51","tos.text-unit.sid-c8e9e850b816f1db51f391e81ec26f51"]},"form":"geschenkt","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"animals","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"source-use","neighbours":["dance","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Имена и звуки дарят отдых, речь танцует над вещами.","en":"Names and sounds give refreshment; speech dances over things."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.14","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-c0f42aa81160c9dadc492a1cef5dd98f","tos.text-unit.sid-c0f42aa81160c9dadc492a1cef5dd98f"]},"form":"Schenken","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra-soul","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"source-use","neighbours":["necessity","zarathustra","zarathustra-soul"],"line":{"ru":"Дарение спрашивается как нужда, принятие как милосердие.","en":"Giving is questioned as a need, receiving as mercy."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-6078c820db50344df425ea10af89abe9","tos.text-unit.sid-6078c820db50344df425ea10af89abe9"]},"form":"geschenkt","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["becoming","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель расточает полученные дары тысячей рук.","en":"The teacher lavishes received gifts with a thousand hands."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.07","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-3ae37eee5307bc533e112969700d2b11","tos.text-unit.sid-3ae37eee5307bc533e112969700d2b11"]},"form":"schenkte","speaker":"narrator","addressee":"","mode":"narration","use":"narration","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","necessity"],"line":{"ru":"Поиск страдающего сопровождается благодарностью дарам дня.","en":"The search for the suffering one is accompanied by gratitude for the day’s gifts."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.08","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-b1ffddc7cedb5d25fff4d1e6e37ad47c","tos.text-unit.sid-b1ffddc7cedb5d25fff4d1e6e37ad47c"]},"form":"Geschenk","speaker":"narrator","addressee":"","mode":"narration","use":"narration","group":"source-use","line":{"ru":"Нищий принимает узнавание учителя как драгоценный дар.","en":"The beggar receives recognition of the teacher as a precious gift."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.08","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-8d6093cbded780ddbfe1f48e8018e5db","tos.text-unit.sid-8d6093cbded780ddbfe1f48e8018e5db"]},"form":"schenke","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"beggar","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Дар богатого сердца встречает отказ бедных.","en":"The wealthy heart’s gift meets the poor people’s refusal."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.08","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-7213f771ff84cbf039682ea79414fa06","tos.text-unit.sid-7213f771ff84cbf039682ea79414fa06"]},"form":"schenken","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"beggar","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Хорошее дарение названо последним искусством доброты.","en":"Good giving is named goodness’s final art."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.11","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-51349b585c67c1f2128a54d5a7842e63","tos.text-unit.sid-51349b585c67c1f2128a54d5a7842e63"]},"form":"Gastgeschenk","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["identity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Гости сами дарят учителю силу ответного дара.","en":"The guests themselves give the teacher power to give in return."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.11","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-09dbfa04d6f16c6b8baeec9d7cbae247","tos.text-unit.sid-09dbfa04d6f16c6b8baeec9d7cbae247"]},"form":"Gastgeschenk","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["child","becoming","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Разговор о детях становится желанным гостевым даром.","en":"Speaking of the children becomes the desired guest-gift."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.19","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-fb48fa3c5d1243c0b134ec22b32b2230","tos.text-unit.sid-fb48fa3c5d1243c0b134ec22b32b2230"]},"form":"schenkt","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Избыток радости дарит и благодарит принимающего.","en":"Joy’s excess gives and thanks the recipient."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.20","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-72fc1a4a9dd64e76fa68ff0558ac73e5","tos.text-unit.sid-72fc1a4a9dd64e76fa68ff0558ac73e5"]},"form":"schenkst","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"sun","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель спрашивает о стыде солнца, раздающего свет спящим.","en":"The teacher asks about the shame of a sun giving light to sleepers."}}]}
